  "description": "Nalix.Framework is a high-performance foundational library that provides core building blocks for the Nalix ecosystem — including dependency injection, task orchestration, memory pooling, identity generation, and diagnostic event infrastructure.\n\nDesigned for modern .NET 10, it follows SOLID and Domain-Driven Design (DDD) principles, emphasizing zero-allocation performance, thread safety, and secure coding practices.",
